# Licensing

This repository is **dual-licensed by component**. Each component carries its own
LICENSE file; this notice explains the split.

- **MIT** — `mcp-server/`, the `extension/` install/pack scripts (`extension/install.mjs`,
  `extension/pack.mjs`), `docs/`, `.claude/`, and the repository tooling.
  See [`mcp-server/LICENSE`](mcp-server/LICENSE).
  The MCP server talks to EEZ Studio only over the documented WebSocket protocol
  (`docs/PROTOCOL.md`); it does not link EEZ Studio code, so it is independently reusable
  under the MIT license.

- **GPL-3.0-only** — `bridge/` (both `src/` and `dist/`).
  See [`bridge/LICENSE`](bridge/LICENSE).
  The bridge is compiled into and linked with EEZ Studio and calls its internals directly,
  making it a **derivative work of EEZ Studio** (which is GPL-3.0-only). The bridge ships as
  the MCP Bridge extension (installed into an existing EEZ Studio via `extension/install.mjs`
  or packed with `extension/pack.mjs`). Any distribution of a bridge-enabled EEZ Studio must
  comply with GPL-3.0.

`studio/` is **not** part of this repository — it is a local clone of EEZ Studio that you
provide yourself (see `bridge/README.md`).

Copyright (c) 2026 the eez-studio-mcp-server authors.
